  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Une journée chargée chez Noy.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມາຊ່ວຍແດ່ເດີ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຖ້າແປັບໜຶ່ງເດີ້</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄວໆແດ່ສາ!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມາແລ້ວເດ້!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ພວກເຈົ້າມ່ວນເນາະ</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Máa sūay dɛ̀ɛ dɤ̌ɤ.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Thâa pɛ́p nʉ̀ng dɤ̂ɤ.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Wáy-wáy dɛ̀ɛ sǎa!</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Máa lɛ̏ɛw dê!</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Phûak-jâo mūan nɔ̄.</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Noy</b> — Viens m&#x27;aider, s&#x27;il te plaît.<br><b>Kèo</b> — Attends une minute.<br><b>Noy</b> — Dépêche-toi donc !<br><b>Kèo</b> — J&#x27;arrive, voilà !<br><b>Clara</b> — Vous êtes drôles, vous.</p></details>"
